 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！还记得第十八集吗？一天要吃三顿饭。今天，我们来看看每顿饭都吃些什么。"
    },
    {
     "en": "three meals a day"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:breakfast",
    "focus:breakfast"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "早上起床吃的第一顿饭，是早餐："
    },
    {
     "en": "breakfast"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它是两个词拼起来的：打破，加上禁食。睡了一整夜，饿了很久，现在终于可以吃东西啦！"
    },
    {
     "en": "break"
    },
    {
     "en": "fast"
    },
    {
     "en": "breakfast"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:porridge",
    "edge:breakfast>porridge",
    "focus:porridge"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "早餐可以喝一碗热乎乎的粥："
    },
    {
     "en": "porridge"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:pancake",
    "edge:breakfast>pancake",
    "focus:pancake"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "也可以吃一叠软软的薄煎饼。平底锅，加上蛋糕："
    },
    {
     "en": "pan"
    },
    {
     "en": "cake"
    },
    {
     "en": "pancake"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:butter",
    "edge:butter>pancake",
    "focus:butter"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "煎饼上抹一块黄油，香喷喷的："
    },
    {
     "en": "butter"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:prefer",
    "edge:prefer>porridge",
    "focus:prefer"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "粥和煎饼，你更喜欢哪一个？更喜欢，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "prefer"
    },
    {
     "en": "I prefer porridge for breakfast.",
     "cue": [
      "focus:prefer,porridge"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:lunch",
    "focus:lunch"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "中午吃的饭，是午餐："
    },
    {
     "en": "lunch"
    },
    {
     "en": "Lunch time!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sandwich",
    "edge:lunch>sandwich",
    "focus:sandwich"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "午餐带一个三明治："
    },
    {
     "en": "sandwich"
    },
    {
     "zh": "中间的字母 d，读的时候几乎听不到。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:bread",
    "edge:sandwich>bread",
    "focus:bread"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "三明治是用面包做的："
    },
    {
     "en": "bread"
    },
    {
     "zh": "面包通常不加 s。一片面包，要说"
    },
    {
     "en": "a slice of bread"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:salad",
    "edge:lunch>salad",
    "focus:salad"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "再配一碗新鲜的蔬菜沙拉："
    },
    {
     "en": "salad"
    },
    {
     "en": "I eat salad at noon."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:noodles",
    "edge:lunch>noodles",
    "focus:noodles"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "中国小朋友午餐还爱吃面条。面条长长的、很多根，所以总是带着 s："
    },
    {
     "en": "noodles"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:dinner",
    "focus:dinner"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "傍晚，一家人坐在一起，吃晚餐："
    },
    {
     "en": "dinner"
    },
    {
     "en": "Dinner is ready!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hamburger",
    "edge:dinner>hamburger",
    "focus:hamburger"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "晚餐吃一个大大的汉堡包："
    },
    {
     "en": "hamburger"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:spaghetti",
    "edge:dinner>spaghetti",
    "focus:spaghetti"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "或者一盘意大利面："
    },
    {
     "en": "spaghetti"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它是从意大利来的词，g 后面跟着一个不发音的 h。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sausage",
    "edge:dinner>sausage",
    "focus:sausage"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "再来一根烤香肠："
    },
    {
     "en": "sausage"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:breakfast,lunch,dinner"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一天三顿饭，按顺序读一遍："
    },
    {
     "en": "breakfast in the morning",
     "cue": [
      "focus:breakfast"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "lunch at noon",
     "cue": [
      "focus:lunch"
     ]
    },
    {
