  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "你最喜欢吃什么呢？像这样说一说吧："
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "For breakfast, I have porridge.",
